<!-- Confirm key, disabled state — shown until MIN_PIN_LEN digits are entered.
     Flat muted-lavender oval (matches ls_dot_empty used elsewhere on this screen)
     so it visibly reads as "not yet tappable" next to the gradient backspace key. -->
